abstract: >-
  Two playable patrols through a fog-bound Cascadian redwood grove, built around
  the Office of Synergetics Services gallery: a first-person Three.js field
  station and a 2.5D storybook patrol. Synergetic geometry (the jitterbug,
  quadray coordinates, the isotropic vector matrix, tensegrity, Fuller's A
  modules) is shown in play rather than explained. Both games run QuadCraft's
  quadray code and a tested port of QuadMath's exact tetravolume, and a paper in
  docs/manuscript, rendered through docxology/template, describes the geometry
  and how each claim about it is checked.
